WEBVTT

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:14.690
<i>Kakugane, the paranormal alloy forged</i> <i>from the essence of alchemy...</i>

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:18.930
<i>Activated by the person's fighting instinct,</i>

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:22.270
<i>the possessor converts</i> <i>their latent power into form</i>

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:25.370
<i>and creates a weapon like no other.</i>

00:00:26.510 --> 00:00:29.310
<i>That is Buso Renkin.</i>

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:37.460
All right, you guys. Clean out your ears and listen carefully!

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:41.330
Now I'll tell you everything about the LXE!

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:43.900
But before that, Tsumurin!
On your knees and apologize.

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:44.570
Huh?

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:47.410
When you were fighting, you tried to kill Ouka, right?

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:50.610
lf she dies, l disappear along with her, you jerk.

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:53.850
ln the first place, you can't get information if you kill Ouka and Shusui,

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:55.410
so pull your punches!

00:00:55.490 --> 00:00:59.320
You're not so bright, are you?
You're a failure as a warrior. Quit already!

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:02.320
Now, now.

00:01:02.690 --> 00:01:05.660
She may not look it, but warrior Tokiko is very gifted.

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:07.460
Although she is beyond our control

00:01:07.530 --> 00:01:09.230
once she loses her temper and goes berserk.

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:11.490
She's really very nice.

00:01:11.570 --> 00:01:13.400
Though she'll immediately want to splatter everyone's guts out.

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:15.170
You guys get down on your knees and apologize later.

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:18.470
lt'll get dark soon at this rate, so I'll talk first.

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:21.950
The League of Extraordinary Elects, commonly known as the LXE.

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:23.540
The brief overview is...!

00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:28.740
lt's a community of homunculi and familiars in the northern Kanto area!

00:01:29.050 --> 00:01:30.650
The number of homunculi is unknown.

00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:32.280
The number of familiars is unknown.

00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:34.250
The number of kakugane is unknown.

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:35.520
That's no good.

00:01:35.660 --> 00:01:36.530
Good-for-nothing.

00:01:36.860 --> 00:01:39.830
lt can't be helped!
Ouka is low on the totem pole!

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:42.060
But the hideout has been revealed.

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:43.630
A cottage in the forest in the outskirts

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:44.960
of Ginsei City.

00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:46.930
Under normal circumstances,

00:01:47.010 --> 00:01:49.240
l'd want to bring each and every one of them down in one fell swoop.

00:01:49.440 --> 00:01:50.770
But if we don't act quickly,

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:53.970
there's the possibility of the traitor warrior getting back into peak condition.

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:56.910
Before that happens, we must defeat Doctor Butterfly!

00:01:57.180 --> 00:02:00.710
The operation will begin in thirteen hours.
Tomorrow morning at eight!

00:02:01.050 --> 00:02:01.950
Roger...

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:11.120
<i>Carnival</i>

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:24.030
Hey-hey-hey, come on. ls Kazuki gonna be okay?

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:26.130
He's looking all stiff from nervousness.

00:02:26.210 --> 00:02:28.870
l don't blame him. lt's his first major battle.

00:02:29.150 --> 00:02:29.810
Yes.

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:33.150
But enemies don't care about that.

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:38.820
But l believe... he is worthy of being a warrior.

00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:45.350
Now then, as for the global situation...

00:02:45.460 --> 00:02:48.760
What, isn't there anything more interesting written in there?

00:02:49.070 --> 00:02:51.230
Oh, you're finally here!

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:53.600
You're late. What were you doing?

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:55.500
They're right...Kazuki.

00:02:56.970 --> 00:02:58.470
What were all of you guys doing?

00:02:58.540 --> 00:03:00.910
We were waiting for you is what we were doing.

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:03.840
The hospital visit went well, right?
How'd it go?

00:03:03.980 --> 00:03:05.610
Oh, that thing, huh?

00:03:05.880 --> 00:03:07.820
But how did you know it was me.

00:03:08.350 --> 00:03:10.080
lt's so dark you couldn't see my face, right?

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:12.880
We've been together since our first year of junior high school.

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:14.390
You know better than that.

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:16.030
We can tell it's you first try,

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:17.890
even without seeing that moronic face of yours.

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:20.660
l see.

00:03:22.730 --> 00:03:26.300
So, Ouka Senpai is going to be hospitalized a little while longer.

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:29.810
l wonder what Shusui Senpai is going to do about school...

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:32.270
But this kind of takes us back.

00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:35.040
Buying between-meal snacks at the convenience store and chatting around.

00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:36.370
Wasn't that our usual thing

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:38.280
when we'd go home from cram school in our third year of junior high?

00:03:38.350 --> 00:03:41.050
True, we haven't done stuff like that as much after entering high school.

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:42.140
Lately, in particular.

00:03:42.290 --> 00:03:44.150
That's because a certain someone has been obsessed

00:03:44.220 --> 00:03:46.050
over Tokiko all the while!

00:03:46.220 --> 00:03:49.630
l don't recall being obsessed.
But l'm really sorry!

00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:53.330
Golden Week passed by without us really doing anything, so...

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:56.730
Then let's draw up a plan for summer vacation.

00:03:56.800 --> 00:03:58.290
Let's go to the beach, the beach!

00:03:58.370 --> 00:03:59.230
That sounds good!

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:00.640
All right, we're settled on the beach!

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:02.500
No running out on us, Kazuki!

00:04:02.570 --> 00:04:05.300
l mean, bring Tokiko no matter what!

00:04:05.540 --> 00:04:06.270
Right.

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:10.570
lt doesn't look like we'll be able to avoid a major battle

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:12.010
with the alchemist warriors.

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:13.850
l'm going to have you fight as well.

00:04:13.990 --> 00:04:15.420
That's just what l want!

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:19.050
Oh, yeah. lf you're talking about fighting strength, what about Papillon?

00:04:19.220 --> 00:04:21.220
l think he could fight okay in his own way.

00:04:21.290 --> 00:04:22.850
No, he's no good.

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:25.660
Oh, really?

00:04:26.230 --> 00:04:30.000
After all, he's just a dullard who could only become

00:04:30.070 --> 00:04:33.440
an incomplete homunculus despite using my research.

00:04:33.740 --> 00:04:35.040
lf he leaves here,

00:04:35.110 --> 00:04:37.670
he'll be found immediately by the alchemist warriors

00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:40.040
and get taken out.

00:04:40.410 --> 00:04:42.810
He may be a butterfly,

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:46.870
but he's a good-for-nothing who can't fly high or far by himself.

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:50.750
Even so, he is more or less a homunculus,

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:54.390
so l'm protecting him for pity's sake.

00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:05.430
l can't fly high or far by myself, eh, my ancestor?

00:05:06.640 --> 00:05:09.000
Then I'll try testing one thing out.

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:11.110
Buso Renkin!

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:23.950
lt's been a long time...
This feeling.

00:05:24.860 --> 00:05:27.790
This pain! This agony!

00:05:28.360 --> 00:05:31.190
l'd forgotten the ecstasy of near-death for a good while!

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:36.330
Thanks for protecting me until now, my ancestor!

00:05:36.870 --> 00:05:38.800
ln appreciation, I'll show you...

00:05:38.870 --> 00:05:40.530
how well l can fly!

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:43.010
—Morning.
—Morning!

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:45.670
Morning, Mahiro.

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:47.170
Have you seen Kazuki?

00:05:47.310 --> 00:05:49.870
Morning. l didn't see him this morning.

00:05:49.980 --> 00:05:53.320
l see. About going to the ocean this summer vacation...

00:05:53.380 --> 00:05:55.320
Oh! Me, too! Me, too!

00:05:55.490 --> 00:05:56.320
Of course!

00:05:56.450 --> 00:05:57.820
Yay! Yaaay!

00:05:57.890 --> 00:06:01.160
l checked out some possible places on the internet last night.

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:03.450
But where'd that Kazuki go?

00:06:24.220 --> 00:06:26.510
Say, can you swim, Tokiko?

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:30.150
Are you making fun of me?
What're you talking about?

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:31.650
Oh, l'm talking about all of us

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:33.120
going to the beach during summer vacation.

00:06:33.190 --> 00:06:34.780
ls this discussion necessary right now?!

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:36.250
Warrior Kazuki!

00:06:37.030 --> 00:06:38.860
I'll drive the car!

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:41.430
Roger!

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:42.990
Warrior Chief...

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:45.600
But before that, we're going to eliminate

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:47.760
the source of dark alchemy that's grown thick in this land!

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:54.450
The deep inside this cottage.
That's Doctor Butterfly's laboratory.

00:06:54.950 --> 00:06:56.350
—All right, let's go!
—All right, let's go!

00:06:56.510 --> 00:06:57.350
Hold it!

00:06:57.820 --> 00:06:58.650
Angel Gozen?

00:06:58.780 --> 00:07:02.480
lt'll explode if you don't unlock it by answering the password.

00:07:03.890 --> 00:07:05.250
What's the password?

00:07:05.390 --> 00:07:07.790
I'll tell you guys the password.

00:07:08.130 --> 00:07:12.260
And what's required lastly is for each of you to strike a cool pose!

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:14.060
Strike poses, you say?!

00:07:14.130 --> 00:07:16.070
No way can l do something embarrassing like that!

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:17.330
Let's do it, Tokiko.

00:07:17.400 --> 00:07:18.800
Let's do it, Warrior Tokiko.

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:20.930
Why are you two so into this?!

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:22.230
What're you going to do?

00:07:22.310 --> 00:07:24.140
The door won't open if we don't all do it.

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:25.110
Shut up!

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:26.400
ln one hand...

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:27.240
A pistol.

00:07:27.310 --> 00:07:29.040
Wait! Don't move on yet.

00:07:29.350 --> 00:07:30.470
ln one's heart...

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:31.410
A bouquet of flowers.

00:07:31.520 --> 00:07:32.780
Please, Tokiko.

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:36.150
On one's lips...

00:07:36.790 --> 00:07:37.780
Liquor of fire.

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:38.960
On one's back...

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:39.720
Now!

00:07:40.760 --> 00:07:44.350
Life.

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:56.060
Well, no one's stupid enough to open the door knowing an enemy's there.

00:07:57.210 --> 00:07:58.140
—That's true!
—That's true!

00:07:58.380 --> 00:08:01.900
Don't think they can get away so easily after making me do this much.

00:08:02.650 --> 00:08:03.580
Buso Renkin!

00:08:05.520 --> 00:08:06.210
Let's go!

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:10.150
—Warrior Chief.
—Yeah.

00:08:10.520 --> 00:08:12.850
l'd heard that security was lax during the day,

00:08:12.920 --> 00:08:14.980
but to think there wouldn't be any presence at all...

00:08:15.490 --> 00:08:17.490
This is the place, Kazukin! Come on!

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:20.430
Let's go. Sunlight Slasher!

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:29.200
So this...is the deepest part of the...

00:08:29.270 --> 00:08:30.470
LXE hideout, huh...?

00:08:30.710 --> 00:08:32.940
Doctor Butterfly's laboratory...

00:08:33.010 --> 00:08:34.140
Whoa?!

00:08:34.350 --> 00:08:35.310
What's the matter, Angel Gozen?

00:08:35.380 --> 00:08:36.400
lt's gone!

00:08:36.480 --> 00:08:37.140
What is?

00:08:37.210 --> 00:08:40.410
The restoration flask in the heart of the laboratory is gone!

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:45.750
That's because his body is almost completely restored.

00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:48.650
He'll be resurrected if we complete the supplementation of his nutrition.

00:08:48.860 --> 00:08:51.760
So Doctor Butterfly took him away.

00:08:52.660 --> 00:08:54.430
Are you a humanoid?

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:58.190
Of course! My name used to be Lunar Nicholai.

00:08:58.270 --> 00:08:59.740
Now l'm Moon Face.

00:09:00.170 --> 00:09:02.900
And this... is my Buso Renkin.

00:09:03.510 --> 00:09:05.240
Where'd Doctor Butterfly go?!

00:09:05.580 --> 00:09:07.240
lt's a simple quiz, isn't it?

00:09:07.410 --> 00:09:11.280
What's a place nearby that's brimming with young life?

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:13.010
lt couldn't be...

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:14.070
Ginsei Academy?!

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:16.240
Correct!

00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:18.850
Direct hit! Bravo Fist!

00:09:20.890 --> 00:09:22.480
Let's hurry. Everyone's in danger!

00:09:25.400 --> 00:09:26.730
Moon...

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:31.170
l think it's a joke to send just kids, though.

00:09:31.470 --> 00:09:33.730
lt's needless to worry about those two.

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:37.670
Also, the only enemy remaining here is you.

00:09:38.180 --> 00:09:40.970
lt'll be concluded if l take care of you with a swift attack!

00:09:41.050 --> 00:09:44.380
lndeed. But...

00:09:44.720 --> 00:09:46.710
—that'd be if it were just one of me, right?
—that'd be if it were just one of me, right?

00:09:49.550 --> 00:09:52.350
Please let us make it in time.
Please be safe, guys!

00:09:53.060 --> 00:09:54.820
Wh-What's that?!

00:09:56.560 --> 00:09:58.760
That's...coming from the school!

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:05.090
Hey, there's a ton of fog outside.

00:10:05.270 --> 00:10:06.970
l can't see outside the school at all!

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:09.700
Hey, get back to class!

00:10:09.770 --> 00:10:11.610
No good. My cell phone won't work.

00:10:11.780 --> 00:10:12.680
Mine, too!

00:10:12.780 --> 00:10:13.640
Be quiet!

00:10:13.910 --> 00:10:16.470
The teachers are outside now checking things out.

00:10:16.780 --> 00:10:18.980
Anyway, just stay calm.

00:10:19.580 --> 00:10:21.920
What's the matter, Takagishi Sensei?

00:10:24.760 --> 00:10:25.850
We can't get out...

00:10:26.190 --> 00:10:26.890
Huh...?

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:28.890
l should be heading for the school gate,

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:31.830
but before l know it l end up back where l started...

00:10:32.600 --> 00:10:34.330
lt's like a sea of trees...

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:36.600
This fog isn't natural!

00:10:39.170 --> 00:10:40.400
Did Big Brother come?

00:10:40.470 --> 00:10:43.000
No, neither he nor Tokiko have come yet.

00:10:43.270 --> 00:10:44.500
This doesn't look good.

00:10:44.710 --> 00:10:46.470
lt'd be better if you stay together with us.

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:49.510
Yeah. l'm going to go get
Chii-chan and Saa-chan...

00:10:49.610 --> 00:10:51.140
Hey, what's that?!

00:10:51.620 --> 00:10:52.950
There's something in the schoolyard!

00:11:05.030 --> 00:11:06.290
The car navigation isn't working!

00:11:06.360 --> 00:11:07.800
What's going on with the traffic light?!

00:11:07.870 --> 00:11:09.330
You idiot! l have the right of way.

00:11:09.530 --> 00:11:10.730
Whoa! Look out!

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:13.300
Chief!

00:11:13.370 --> 00:11:14.840
Oh, how'd it go?

00:11:16.340 --> 00:11:19.570
Actually... No matter what l do, l can't move ahead from here.

00:11:20.180 --> 00:11:21.940
What did you say?
What's up ahead?

00:11:22.110 --> 00:11:24.950
lf l remember correctly, it's the Ginsei Private Academy.

00:11:26.050 --> 00:11:27.540
Tokiko, this fog!

00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:29.850
You also noticed, huh?
Be careful!

00:11:30.190 --> 00:11:33.320
lf you look really carefully, there are metal particles mixed in.

00:11:33.890 --> 00:11:35.090
This is a Buso Renkin!

00:11:38.230 --> 00:11:40.700
The special property throws off people's sense of direction

00:11:40.870 --> 00:11:42.930
and blocks off the inside of the fog and the outside!

00:11:43.470 --> 00:11:44.960
Darn it. Which way?!

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:47.470
This way, Kazuki!

00:11:47.870 --> 00:11:49.770
Angel Gozen!
You know the way?

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:53.010
My Angel Eyes can totally see through far and clear!

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:55.010
Let's go. Follow me!

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:55.640
Right!

00:11:55.750 --> 00:11:58.810
Kazuki, hide your face with something while you have the chance.

00:11:59.250 --> 00:12:01.120
lt'd be pretty bad if your identity were to be known

00:12:01.190 --> 00:12:02.240
by the students in school.

00:12:02.420 --> 00:12:04.620
Got it. But what about you, Tokiko?

00:12:04.760 --> 00:12:06.990
l can hide with my hair, and there's also this fog.

00:12:07.320 --> 00:12:09.290
Rather, the problem is this uniform.

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:11.090
All right, then...

00:12:11.860 --> 00:12:12.890
l brought them.

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:13.730
Good.

00:12:13.930 --> 00:12:16.870
Hey, Mappi. ls it okay for us to leave class?

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:18.160
lt doesn't matter.

00:12:18.240 --> 00:12:21.640
The teachers haven't been able to grasp the situation, anyway.

00:12:21.910 --> 00:12:24.970
We'll be there for you guys in a pinch, so rest easy.

00:12:25.040 --> 00:12:26.480
To be honest, l'm scared.

00:12:26.610 --> 00:12:28.740
But l think we should at least be able to buy some time to escape.

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:31.040
Hey, the things in the schoolyard started moving!

00:12:33.280 --> 00:12:34.750
Oh, no!
They're coming this way!

00:12:34.820 --> 00:12:35.980
What're...those things?

00:12:40.090 --> 00:12:41.750
Feed us!

00:12:56.440 --> 00:12:59.040
The Revised Humanoid Homunculi.

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:03.310
l set out to create Homunculi that can stand against

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:07.480
the alchemist warriors without Buso Renkin, but...

00:13:08.020 --> 00:13:10.540
As l thought, it is still far inferior to you.

00:13:11.190 --> 00:13:12.280
But even so,

00:13:12.360 --> 00:13:15.550
l do take pride in having completed a good specimen...

00:13:15.630 --> 00:13:17.890
at least in terms of fighting strength.

00:13:19.830 --> 00:13:21.800
Feed me!

00:13:25.640 --> 00:13:27.300
Feed me!

00:13:27.370 --> 00:13:28.740
—Buso Renkin!
—Buso Renkin!

00:13:35.180 --> 00:13:36.080
We made it in time!

00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:39.910
So the alchemist warriors have appeared.

00:13:42.720 --> 00:13:44.380
Here we come, you monsters!

00:13:44.460 --> 00:13:47.250
No way will l let you get any closer to the school building!

00:13:52.360 --> 00:13:53.160
What?

00:13:53.230 --> 00:13:54.890
They're fighting the monsters?!

00:13:54.970 --> 00:13:56.560
Who're those two?

00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:05.770
Are they fighting each other?

00:14:05.840 --> 00:14:08.040
No, just two of them look human.

00:14:14.280 --> 00:14:16.910
But to think they can fight those monsters.

00:14:17.090 --> 00:14:18.450
Are those two human?

00:14:18.520 --> 00:14:19.920
Those two are...!

00:14:20.160 --> 00:14:21.060
<i>Monsters!</i>

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:23.990
<i>Monsters are attacking the school!</i>

00:14:24.360 --> 00:14:27.530
<i>Let's all work together</i> <i>and protect the school!</i>

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:29.590
<i>l'm Shinyo Suzuki,</i>

00:14:29.670 --> 00:14:32.030
<i>the student council secretary</i> <i>and deputy student council president!</i>

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:34.770
<i>The school presently has</i> <i>no contact with the outside world,</i>

00:14:34.840 --> 00:14:36.200
<i>left high and dry.</i>

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:37.370
<i>Until help arrives,</i>

00:14:37.440 --> 00:14:39.430
<i>we must not let the monsters</i> <i>fighting outside</i>

00:14:39.510 --> 00:14:41.640
<i>approach the school building!</i>

00:14:43.280 --> 00:14:44.540
All of them?

00:14:45.050 --> 00:14:46.180
Monsters?

00:14:46.350 --> 00:14:47.410
You idiot!

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:49.640
Okakura, Daihama.

00:14:49.720 --> 00:14:50.650
l know!

00:14:50.720 --> 00:14:51.750
—Let's go!
—Let's go!

00:14:51.820 --> 00:14:53.290
<i>They're all monsters.</i>

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:55.580
<i>Whether or not they have</i> <i>taken on human form,</i>

00:14:55.660 --> 00:14:57.890
<i>all of them in the schoolyard</i> <i>are monsters!</i>

00:14:58.060 --> 00:14:59.860
<i>Do not let them in, no matter what!</i>

00:15:04.060 --> 00:15:05.660
—No!
—Chii-chan!

00:15:05.760 --> 00:15:08.000
Monsters! lt's the same as that time!

00:15:08.070 --> 00:15:10.060
They're in human form but are monsters!

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:11.990
—Chii-chan!
—Hang in there!

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:13.200
Hey, look...

00:15:13.670 --> 00:15:14.570
lt's a monster...

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:15.610
That's...

00:15:15.670 --> 00:15:16.640
Unbelievable...!

00:15:16.840 --> 00:15:21.040
<i>Everyone's help is necessary to protect</i> <i>the school from the monsters!</i>

00:15:21.280 --> 00:15:24.050
<i>Let's show those monsters!</i>

00:15:24.350 --> 00:15:26.410
<i>We'll all protect the school together!</i>

00:15:27.590 --> 00:15:28.550
Serves you right!

00:15:30.590 --> 00:15:31.490
Stay away!

00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:33.060
Get out!

00:15:33.390 --> 00:15:34.290
Monster!

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:35.330
Stay back!

00:15:35.390 --> 00:15:36.590
You monster!

00:15:37.560 --> 00:15:38.760
What're you doing?!

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:41.030
They're fighting to protect you guys!

00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:42.230
lt's okay, Angel Gozen.

00:15:43.640 --> 00:15:46.100
This isn't the time to get them to believe us.

00:15:46.740 --> 00:15:47.670
Exactly.

00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:49.600
This is the time to fight!

00:15:51.440 --> 00:15:52.540
Kazuki...

00:15:52.980 --> 00:15:55.470
The will to resist!
The will to refuse!

00:15:55.650 --> 00:15:58.380
<i>Bags! Notebooks!</i>
<i>Desks! Chairs!</i>

00:15:58.450 --> 00:16:00.320
<i>Although small individually,</i>

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:03.580
<i>they should certainly chip away</i> <i>at the monsters' will to fight,</i>

00:16:03.660 --> 00:16:05.150
<i>albeit little by little!</i>

00:16:05.590 --> 00:16:09.530
Everyone work together and fight off the monsters!

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:15.260
Attacking with backdoor tactics.

00:16:15.330 --> 00:16:18.130
That's a clever idea, familiar Shinyo.

00:16:18.770 --> 00:16:21.430
This assailment should make a deep impression...

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:23.910
on this greenhorn still wet behind the ears.

00:16:25.910 --> 00:16:26.610
Kazuki!

00:16:27.580 --> 00:16:28.550
Uh, oh!

00:16:29.450 --> 00:16:31.010
<i>There's one over there quailing!</i>

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:33.880
l-l've got to...pursue quickly...

00:16:34.620 --> 00:16:35.550
Kazuki!

00:16:35.620 --> 00:16:38.920
<i>Everyone beat down</i> <i>that monster at once...</i>

00:16:41.190 --> 00:16:42.390
Darn it. lt won't open!

00:16:42.490 --> 00:16:44.090
lt's locked from the inside.

00:16:44.630 --> 00:16:46.430
Daihama, you try!

00:16:46.800 --> 00:16:48.270
l'm not really confident, though...

00:16:50.970 --> 00:16:51.770
Daihama?!

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:54.000
You jerk!

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:56.040
What're you doing talking nonsense?!

00:16:57.910 --> 00:16:59.500
What do you mean nonsense?

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:04.940
l'm doing this broadcast to protect the school from the monsters.

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:06.180
You jerk!

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:08.680
Suzuki, you're pursuing the matter

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:13.160
as if everything in the schoolyard is a monster and enemy.

00:17:13.930 --> 00:17:16.950
<i>But aren't the two fighting</i> <i>the monsters who appeared later...</i>

00:17:17.030 --> 00:17:19.230
<i>humans just like us?</i>

00:17:20.930 --> 00:17:21.730
Rokumasu...?

00:17:21.800 --> 00:17:24.570
<i>No way could there be a human</i> <i>who could fight on even terms</i>

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:27.110
<i>against such a huge army of monsters.</i>

00:17:29.240 --> 00:17:32.010
Try thinking with more common sense.

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:34.910
This situation itself already isn't common sense.

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:38.340
ls this common sense to you, Suzuki?

00:17:38.680 --> 00:17:39.980
Either way, there's no doubt

00:17:40.050 --> 00:17:42.540
that we don't know who those individuals are.

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:46.560
We must not acknowledge them as being on our side.

00:17:47.160 --> 00:17:48.680
We know who they are.

00:17:48.890 --> 00:17:49.920
Those two...

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:51.550
are our friends!

00:17:54.770 --> 00:17:56.630
<i>Talk about being driven by distress.</i>

00:17:56.700 --> 00:18:01.870
<i>Friends? On what basis?</i>
<i>We can't see faces in this fog.</i>

00:18:02.140 --> 00:18:03.670
Not to mention the fact that

00:18:03.740 --> 00:18:06.340
one of them even has the indications of deliberately hiding.

00:18:06.450 --> 00:18:07.310
We can tell.

00:18:07.380 --> 00:18:09.470
Even if we can't see his moronic face...

00:18:09.550 --> 00:18:10.710
We can tell right way!

00:18:11.050 --> 00:18:13.180
<i>The ones fighting are our friends.</i>

00:18:13.450 --> 00:18:15.790
<i>—Allies of us all!</i>
<i>—Allies of us all!</i>

00:18:24.100 --> 00:18:25.460
That's right, you moron!

00:18:26.700 --> 00:18:28.630
That fool is such an idiot,

00:18:28.700 --> 00:18:30.930
he went so far as to save the life of an enemy

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:32.490
who tried to kill him!

00:18:32.570 --> 00:18:36.300
He's a total, total idiot!
He's a super, super huge idiot!

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:38.240
There's no way...

00:18:39.040 --> 00:18:43.140
that idiot could be your enemy, you moron!

00:18:43.820 --> 00:18:46.310
Angel Gozen, what're you doing here...?

00:18:49.420 --> 00:18:54.020
<i>l heard you, Suzuki.</i>
<i>How do you know this intruder's name?</i>

00:18:54.490 --> 00:18:55.890
<i>Uh...well...</i>

00:18:56.230 --> 00:18:58.930
—What's the idea?
—Which one's right?

00:18:59.630 --> 00:19:01.900
Are the two in the schoolyard allies?

00:19:02.770 --> 00:19:03.830
Could those two be...?!

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:07.500
The monsters have gotten in!

00:19:07.570 --> 00:19:09.910
Get up, Chii-chan!
We have to get out of here!

00:19:10.180 --> 00:19:10.900
No good...

00:19:11.310 --> 00:19:14.840
l'm so scared l can't move...
Run, Saori.

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:16.020
Chii-chan!

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:28.760
—Mahiro!
—Look out, Mappi!

00:19:29.030 --> 00:19:33.900
l'm okay. l've remembered. l told you guys, right?

00:19:34.570 --> 00:19:36.470
About the scary dream a lot like this

00:19:36.540 --> 00:19:38.940
that l had around the time when l first entered school.

00:19:39.710 --> 00:19:42.230
But that was something that really happened.

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:44.970
Big Brother protected me in the end!

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:46.870
Feed me!

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:49.880
So l'm sure he'll protect us this time, too!

00:19:50.220 --> 00:19:53.080
This time he's everyone's ally, so!

00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:58.320
He'll protect all of us!

00:20:14.520 --> 00:20:16.920
The Revised Humanoid Homunculi increase in numbers!

00:20:16.990 --> 00:20:19.110
Doctor Butterfly's plot engulfs the school.

00:20:19.420 --> 00:20:23.360
And with the sound of the flask's alarm, the Homunculi King awakens.

00:20:24.060 --> 00:20:25.990
Next time, "Signs of Death."

00:20:26.600 --> 00:20:28.430
I'll splatter your guts out!
